{"name": "Quantum Era", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25b0\u25b0  <i><strong>QUANTUM ERA</strong></i>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A <strong>Third-person action roguelite</strong> built around <strong>escalation and consequences</strong>. </i><br/><i>The first entry in the <strong>Nomad Chronicles</strong> franchise.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"432\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/5521252d5d87c1e08bef2d4ed5b40554.poster.avif?t=1782501753\" width=\"732\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/5521252d5d87c1e08bef2d4ed5b40554.webm?t=1782501753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/5521252d5d87c1e08bef2d4ed5b40554.mp4?t=1782501753\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25b0\u25b0 <i><strong>THE NOMAD</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>G.I.O-NN.1</strong>, a reconnaissance robot long forgotten on an asteroid to mine its noble metals, he did not find Earth as he left it on its way back, dropped onto a hostile island controlled by autonomous robots protecting energy cores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25b8 MISSION OBJECTIVE:</strong> <strong>infiltrate enemy outposts, unlock powerups, and escape alive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nothing on the island is passive. Every action you take is monitored, evaluated, and answered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"532\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/63a32a0e56229cabdd84c813d5f7bab0.poster.avif?t=1782501753\" width=\"852\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/63a32a0e56229cabdd84c813d5f7bab0.webm?t=1782501753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/63a32a0e56229cabdd84c813d5f7bab0.mp4?t=1782501753\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25b0\u25b0 <i><strong>A WORLD THAT REACTS TO YOU</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies respond to\u00a0noise, combat, and visibility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DETECTION:</strong> Being spotted raises local alert levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ESCALATION:</strong> High attention triggers rapid enemy response.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TERMINATE:</strong> Fail to disengage, and <strong>heavy reinforcements</strong> are deployed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sometimes the smartest move isn\u2019t to win the fight \u2014 it\u2019s knowing <strong>when to run</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"532\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/428fcef7110306ccc333fa96735d5b33.poster.avif?t=1782501753\" width=\"852\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/428fcef7110306ccc333fa96735d5b33.webm?t=1782501753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/428fcef7110306ccc333fa96735d5b33.mp4?t=1782501753\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25b0\u25b0 <i><strong>CHOOSE HOW YOU PLAY</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no single \"correct\" path. Adapt or expire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SILENT:</strong> Move undetected and disable threats before they react.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TACTICAL:</strong> Turn the environment into a lethal weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CHAOTIC:</strong> Go loud and force your way through the consequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your arsenal across every run. You have <strong>3 chances</strong> before total system failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"532\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/dbf97e15f8ffaa15d1f6c2b0001f8f26.poster.avif?t=1782501753\" width=\"852\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/dbf97e15f8ffaa15d1f6c2b0001f8f26.webm?t=1782501753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/dbf97e15f8ffaa15d1f6c2b0001f8f26.mp4?t=1782501753\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25b0\u25b0 <i><strong>ROGUELITE PROGRESSION</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run is new. Each death is a lesson.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UPGRADE:</strong> Unlock random weapons and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ADAPT:</strong> Counter increasingly aggressive enemy AI behavior.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EXPLORE:</strong> Choose from mountain peaks to the sea depths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"532\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/76f868e19707b26340c10359572976a8.poster.avif?t=1782501753\" width=\"852\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/76f868e19707b26340c10359572976a8.webm?t=1782501753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/76f868e19707b26340c10359572976a8.mp4?t=1782501753\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25b0\u25b0 <i><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High-Stakes Combat:</strong> Third-person action roguelite gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reactive AI:</strong> Dynamic enemy alert and escalation system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Freedom:</strong> Stealth, Action, or pure improvisation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progression:</strong> Unlock weapons and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hostile Biomes:</strong> Distinct threats and traversal challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic World:</strong> Procedural seeds, weather, and time cycles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Explore, Fight, Upgrade. Join the roguelite action in third-person, every fight raises alert levels! Conquer outposts, unlock weapons and powerups in an unpredictable procedural environment, get out before the island turns against you!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/26bd14abc24e633ffd9f2f9b4c9749035767d51a/header.jpg?t=1782501753", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Third